      "item": "theoreticalsciences:research_nexus",
      "title": "Research Nexus",
      "text": "A ring of error-corrected cores around a well of light that reads Research Dossiers and studies them in your place, shortening whatever you are researching.$(br2)$(thing)Tier 3$() machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(thing)Made on the Extreme Assembly Table$() (it is also a crafting table). The recipe pages at the end of this entry - and JEI - show the pattern."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Feed it $(item)Research Dossiers$() while you are studying something: each one replaces minutes of waiting. The dossier must be at least as advanced as the entry - empirical, theoretical, unified, absolute."
